top.zh:
我们是冠军！我们是冠军！我们是冠军！
BLG牛逼！！BLG牛逼！！BLG牛逼！！
不是LPL VS LCK ，是BLG VS LCK 我们做到了！[流泪][流泪]
不夸张的讲，今年LOL世界赛绝对是史无前例的一届，汇聚了S3至S16的所有的世界冠军。
这一届的故事绝对是最多最励志的，
IG义薄云天四老带一新重铸极意，4%的概率涅槃登峰，诠释何为羁绊;
TES老9临危受命，危难之中悟道诠释何为成长;
BLG大吵一架之后矛盾解除，开始一心一意冲击比赛，诠释何为团结;
DK再面解散困境，许哥从零开始再度冲击一线生机，诠释何为dwg的初心;
T1faker冲击七冠，诠释何为巅峰;
GENG大超突破心魔，力争一冠，诠释何为证道；
[流泪]我想，我已经很久没看过讨论度这么高的赛了，每个人都有不能输的理由[流泪]
​但是这次，我们不会输！
​伦敦的雨不会淋到纽约，太阳终将会升起！
​24年做不到的，这一次！我要全部做到！
​恭喜BLG！！

top.en:
We are the champions! We are the champions! We are the champions!
BLG is awesome!! BLG is awesome!! BLG is awesome!!
It's not LPL VS LCK, it's BLG VS LCK, we did it![tears][tears]
To be frank, this year's LOL [~0:Worlds] is definitely an unprecedented edition, gathering all World Champions from S3 to S16.
The stories this year are definitely the most numerous and inspiring:
iG showing supreme loyalty with four veterans and one rookie to reforge their peak style, achieving a 4% probability to nirvana and ascend the peak, embodying the meaning of bonds;
TES's Old 9 stepping up in a crisis, finding enlightenment in adversity to embody growth;
BLG resolving their conflicts after a big argument and starting to focus wholeheartedly on the match, embodying unity;
DK facing dissolution once again, with ShowMaker starting from zero to push for a glimmer of survival, embodying DWG's original intention;
T1's Faker pushing for seven titles, embodying the peak;
GENG's Chovy breaking through his inner demons to strive for a title, embodying the pursuit of mastery;
[tears] I think I haven't seen a tournament with this much discussion in a long time, everyone had a reason they couldn't afford to lose[tears]
But this time, we won't lose!
The rain in London won't reach New York, the sun will eventually rise!
Everything we couldn't do in '24, we're doing all of it this time!
Congratulations BLG!!

