top.en:
We are the champions! We are the champions! We are the champions!
BLG is awesome!! BLG is awesome!! BLG is awesome!!
It's not LPL vs LCK, it's BLG vs LCK, and we did it! [tears][tears]
It's no exaggeration to say that this year's Worlds was absolutely unprecedented, gathering all the World Champions from S3 to S16.
The stories this year were the most inspiring:
IG's four veterans and one rookie reforging their spirit, rising from a 4% probability to the peak, defining what bonds are;
TES's veteran 9 stepping up in a crisis, finding enlightenment in danger, defining what growth is;
BLG resolving their conflicts after a big argument and focusing on the tournament, defining what unity is;
DK facing dissolution, ShowMaker starting from scratch to find a glimmer of hope, defining the original intention of DWG;
T1's Faker chasing his 7th title, defining what the peak is;
GEN's Chovy breaking his inner demons to fight for a title, defining what it means to prove oneself;
[tears] I think it's been a long time since I've seen a tournament with this much discussion, everyone had a reason they couldn't lose [tears]
But this time, we won't lose!
The rain in London won't fall on New York, the sun will rise eventually!
What we couldn't do in '24, this time! I'm going to do it all!
Congratulations BLG!!
